  "section": "Vocabulary",
  "text": "Vocabulary\n1. 근처 = Nearby\n이 근처에는 카페가 없어요. = There are no cafes in this vicinity.\n학교가 집 근처에 있어요. = The school is nearby my house.\n2. 안 = Inside\n가방 안에 있어요. = It's inside of the bag.\n3. 가장 / 제일 = The most / best\n4. 걷다 = To walk\n걸어요\n걸을 거야\n5. 혼자 = Alone, on one's own\n저 혼자 살아요 = I live alone\n혼자서 = By oneself\n6. 챙기다 = To take (Important no forget)\nUse it like \"dont forget to take this...\" because is important",
  "topic": "Vocabulary"
 },
